's awesome, though I can't take any credit. It was part of a constantly evolving thread on PT. If you look close and know your lore all of the most recent PT memes are represented.\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 673145, "author": "Kanada Kev", "date": "2011-05-16", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 673177, "author": "timouse", "date": "2011-05-16", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 673381, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-05-18", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\n(The above is from a Global Nerdy entry.)\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 673443, "author": "Ms.Huxtable", "date": "2011-05-19", "text": "\"Space Commander\" = Awesome."}, {"id": 673820, "author": "Kanada Kev", "date": "2011-05-26", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 673987, "author": "Ms.Huxtable", "date": "2011-05-28", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 674118, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-05-31", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 674123, "author": "Kanada Kev", "date": "2011-05-31", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 674191, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-05-31", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 674229, "author": "kookycanooky", "date": "2011-06-01", "text": "Here's some ideas for that one...\n\nMAGNETIC MONOPOLE KAT. IN UR FLUX TUBEZ. KTHXBYE!\n\nor\n\nSEKSY TIEM POLE DANCR IZ LIL BIT SELF CONSHUS\n\nor just this,\n\ncocaine. so much cocaine."}, {"id": 674242, "author": "Jay Funk Dawg", "date": "2011-06-01", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\ni live right across the park from there..\n\nexpensive haircuts, but cheap sausauge"}, {"id": 674429, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-06-05", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nhttp://www.jameshance.com/\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 674498, "author": "Jay Funk Dawg", "date": "2011-06-06", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 674544, "author": "Kanada Kev", "date": "2011-06-07", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nA Last Landing for Space Shuttle Endeavour\n\nCredit: NASA, Bill Ingalls\n\nExplanation: Space shuttle Endeavour is home to stay. In a rare night landing last week, Endeavour glided onto a runway in Cape Canaveral, Florida, USA completing a 16-day mission that included a visit to the International Space Station (ISS). All told, space shuttle Endeavour flew 25 flights since being deployed by NASA in 1992, spending a total of 299 days in space. Endeavour's next mission will be a stationary one in the California Science Center. Even as Endeavour was landing, the space shuttle Atlantis was being rolled out in preparation for the last mission of any Space Shuttle, a mission currently scheduled to being on July 8."}, {"id": 674631, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2011-06-08", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 674795, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-06-11", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nThis is really scare-tree\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 674976, "author": "Dr_Evil_Mouse", "date": "2011-06-14", "text": "Right out of Game of Thrones, I tell ya."}, {"id": 675451, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-06-18", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nItâ€™s the Great Dalek, Charlie Brown\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 675452, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-06-18", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 675788, "author": "Hal Johnson", "date": "2011-06-24", "text": "I literally \"Stumbled\" across this the other day.  Its the picture of a child's skull while it prepares to lose it's baby teeth.  I find it quite fascinating my self...\n\nMIght be disturbing to some"}, {"id": 675893, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-06-26", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 677020, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-07-17", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nRainbow toad rediscovered after 87 years\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 677306, "author": "bradm", "date": "2011-07-21", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nThe Worldâ€™s Most Gargantuan Diesel Engine\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 677607, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2011-07-26", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 677912, "author": "Ms.Huxtable", "date": "2011-08-03", "text": "[Image om