"id": 698261, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-04-12", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 698264, "author": "DevO", "date": "2013-04-12", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 698305, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-04-15", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 698589, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-04-23", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 698973, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-05-03", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 699275, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-05-14", "text": "circa 1972\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 699404, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-05-17", "text": "The Terracotta Army or the \"Terra Cotta Warriors and Horses\", is a collection of terracotta sculptures depicting the armies of Qin Shi Huang, the first Emperor of China.\n\nThe figures, dating from 210 BC, were discovered in 1974 by some local farmers in Lintong District, Xi'an, Shaanxi province, near the Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor.\n\nThe figures vary in height, according to their roles, with the tallest being the generals. The figures include warriors, chariots, horses, officials, acrobats, strongmen and musicians. Current estimates are that in the three pits containing the Terracotta Army there were over 8,000 soldiers, 130 chariots with 520 horses and 150 cavalry horses, the majority of which are still buried in the pits.\n\nAccording to historian Sima Qian (145-90 BC), construction of this mausoleum began in 246 BC and involved 700,000 workers.\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 699737, "author": "guitarberman", "date": "2013-05-29", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 700283, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-06-20", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 700664, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-07-09", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 701025, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-07-26", "text": "Melted and damaged wax figures of the Madame Tussauds gallery after a fire, 1925\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 701969, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-09-17", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 702047, "author": "bradm", "date": "2013-09-23", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 702118, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-09-27", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 702336, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2013-10-21", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 702718, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-11-14", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 702859, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-11-21", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\nfull size:\n\nhttp://i.imgur.com/WjcTW9h.jpg"}, {"id": 703119, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2013-12-10", "text": "Ron Swanson is fucking awesome."}, {"id": 703163, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2013-12-12", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703193, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2013-12-14", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703414, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-01-07", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703475, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-01-10", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703500, "author": "boiler rat", "date": "2014-01-12", "text": "Selfie skills beyond reproach:\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703723, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-01-23", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703874, "author": "Newbaccas Binaca", "date": "2014-02-03", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703876, "author": "kookycanooky", "date": "2014-02-03", "text": "Look at them, dancing around in their underwear...how degrading."}, {"id": 703885, "author": "Newbaccas Binaca", "date": "2014-02-04", "text": "The Emperors' wireless units."}, {"id": 703890, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-02-04", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 703926, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-02-06", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 704127, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-02-20", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\n[Image omitted]\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 704197, "author": "bradm", "date": "2014-02-26", "text": "[Image omitted]\n\n(Thanks to Accordion Guy for the picture.)\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 706916, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2014-08-28", "text": "In 1938, Shirley Temple was ten years old. US congress debated whether she was a communist.   [Image omitted]\n\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 706919, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-08-29", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 706920, "author": "bouche", "date": "2014-08-29", "text": "http://giphy.com/gifs/12Tt4U7hlXXaRa"}, {"id": 708082, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2014-11-27", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 708084, "author": "bradm", "date": "2014-11-27", "text": "Phish Superball tapers' section, July, 2011\n\n[Image omitted]\n\nAloha,\n\nBrad"}, {"id": 709433, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2015-02-16", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 709488, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2015-02-19", "text": "Rome Olympics, 1960. Ethiopian Abebe Bikila of Ethiopia approaches the Arch of Constantine on his way to winning the Olympic marathon in world-record time.\n[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 709505, "author": "Low Roller", "date": "2015-02-19", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 709836, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2015-03-04", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 710257, "author": "Esau.", "date": "2015-03-26", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 710277, "author": "Jay Funk Dawg", "date": "2015-03-27", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 711290, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2015-06-22", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 711511, "author": "Low Roller", "date": "2015-07-13", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 713045, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2015-12-16", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 713557, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2016-02-12", "text": "[Image omitted]"}, {"id": 713631, "author": "Davey Boy 2.0", "date": "2016-02-19", "text": "Close-up of an LP\n\n[Image omitted]"}]}